      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.0",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "I found Sister Mary Rosella noted on August 9th: so have made out her certificate accordingly and am herewith inclosing. I hope it will be satis- factory - glad you called my attention. Please pardon oversight and consequent delay. I can easily understand something of how you feel, hustling all day in the hospiral, etc. It's a great work in itself and a wonderful opportunity to prac- tice charity and of course mortification in so many ways, which brings one nearer to God and endears to the Sacred Heart. Naturally \"social life\" often suffers - and what is to be regretted in many cases - family life too. This latter is realy important and in every way should be supplied as far as possible. . ... .. Prayer in your and O. J.'s case, I trust has helped - and let us hope will help more than anything else under circumstances.",
      "per_polygon": "I found Sister Mary Rosella noted on August 9th: so have made out her certificate accordingly and am herewith inclosing. I hope it will be satis- factory - glad you called my attention. Please pardon oversight and consequent delay. I can easily understand something of how you feel, hustling all day in the hospital, etc. It's a great work in itself and a wonderful opportunity to prac- tice charity and of course mortification in so many ways, which brings one nearer to God and endears to the Sacred Heart. Naturally \"social life\" often suffers - and what is to be regretted in many cases - family life too. This latter is realy important and in every way should be supplied as far as possible. . Prayer in your and O. J.'s case, I trust has helped - and let us hope will help more than anything else under circumstances.",
